==================
marker: DRC Marker
------------------
area: area, Area of the marker as defined by the LEF MACRO SIZE or OVERLAP information
box: rect, Bounding box for marker
box_area: area, Area of bounding box for marker
box_ll: pt, Lower left (ll) of bounding box for marker
box_llx: coord, Lower left X (llx) of bounding box for marker
box_lly: coord, Lower left Y (lly) of bounding box for marker
box_size: pt, Size of bounding box for marker
box_sizex: coord, Size X of bounding box for marker
box_sizey: coord, Size Y of bounding box for marker
box_ur: pt, Upper right (ur) of bounding box for marker
box_urx: coord, Upper Right X (urx) of bounding box for marker
box_ury: coord, Upper Right Y (ury) of bounding box for marker
isFalse(settable): bool, Indicates the marker is marked as false violation by user.
isHidden(settable): bool, Indicates the marker is hidden by user in violation browser.
layer: obj(layer), Pointer to layer
message: string, DRC marker message
messageId: int, DRC marker message ID
objType: enum(antennaData antennaModel bndry bump bumpGrid bumpTerm bus busGuide busSinkGroup cellDensity densityShape fPlan foreign gCellGridDef group guiLine guiPoly guiRect guiText hInst hInstTerm hNet hTerm head inst instTerm io layer layerRule layerShape libCell marker net netGroup pBlkg pWire pd pgInstTerm pin pinGroup pinGuide pinShape pkgComponent pkgObject prop ptn ptnCell ptnPinBlkg rBlkg resistor resizeBlkg routeType row rule sViaInst sWire sdp shape shapeVia site stackViaRule term text topCell trackDef vCell vWire via viaInst viaRuleGenerate whatIfVia whatIfWire wire), Object type: DRC Marker
objects: objList(bump inst instTerm net term), The objects which caused the DRC. The list may be empty, and is currently limited to at most 2 objects.
originator: enum(Ccopt Check CheckFPlan CheckPlace External NRLitho PG RouteDesign Unknown checkPinAssignment checkSafetyMechanism), Marker originator
polyPts: list(pt), Polygon boundary for the marker, the first point is not repeated as the last point in the list
